{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:39:28+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Praise Dead", "steam_appid": 2459180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/3df76801dd7c11d007e75c513ec6279c.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/3df76801dd7c11d007e75c513ec6279c.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/3df76801dd7c11d007e75c513ec6279c.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praise Dead is a roguelike auto-battler about a necromancer keeping a dying village alive. Raise zombies from whatever the graveyard gives you, work them to the bone by day, and throw them at the demons outside the gate by night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build every zombie from parts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag organs onto the body and raise it. Every brain, heart, lung, liver and gut adds its own stats, and those stats decide everything: how hard a zombie hits, how fast it swings, and how much it farms, mines or recruits. Kill a demon and take its parts for your next zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/c7f8150e0f18711d26a326bab271a23c.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/c7f8150e0f18711d26a326bab271a23c.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/c7f8150e0f18711d26a326bab271a23c.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work the village by day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your zombies on the barricade, the farm, the mine, the shrine and the road. The strong ones mine more iron, the lucky ones bring back more villagers. Food, iron, energy and villagers keep the village standing for one more night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/48b70abe16780936875f9885645ef104.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/48b70abe16780936875f9885645ef104.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/48b70abe16780936875f9885645ef104.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold the gate by night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the demons come. Battles play out on their own, so the fight is won in the lab and the village, but your spells can still turn it. Last a week and a boss comes with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/aca0758f781652c8315334e4816aabd4.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/aca0758f781652c8315334e4816aabd4.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/aca0758f781652c8315334e4816aabd4.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relics, necromancers and bosses</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>50+ relics</strong> that change how your zombies work, fight and rise</li><li><strong>4 necromancers</strong>, each with their own starting relics</li><li><strong>4 shops</strong>: the Church sells parts, the Witch sells relics, the Blacksmith trades weapons and armor, and the Demonologist deals in demon parts</li><li><strong>3 bosses</strong> waiting at the end of each week</li><li><strong>Ritual levels</strong> that raise the stakes once you win, and an <strong>Endless Mode</strong> with ever harder waves and 50 events of its own</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/3df76801dd7c11d007e75c513ec6279c.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/3df76801dd7c11d007e75c513ec6279c.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/3df76801dd7c11d007e75c513ec6279c.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praise Dead is a roguelike auto-battler about a necromancer keeping a dying village alive. Raise zombies from whatever the graveyard gives you, work them to the bone by day, and throw them at the demons outside the gate by night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build every zombie from parts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag organs onto the body and raise it. Every brain, heart, lung, liver and gut adds its own stats, and those stats decide everything: how hard a zombie hits, how fast it swings, and how much it farms, mines or recruits. Kill a demon and take its parts for your next zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/c7f8150e0f18711d26a326bab271a23c.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/c7f8150e0f18711d26a326bab271a23c.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/c7f8150e0f18711d26a326bab271a23c.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work the village by day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your zombies on the barricade, the farm, the mine, the shrine and the road. The strong ones mine more iron, the lucky ones bring back more villagers. Food, iron, energy and villagers keep the village standing for one more night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/48b70abe16780936875f9885645ef104.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/48b70abe16780936875f9885645ef104.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/48b70abe16780936875f9885645ef104.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold the gate by night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the demons come. Battles play out on their own, so the fight is won in the lab and the village, but your spells can still turn it. Last a week and a boss comes with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/aca0758f781652c8315334e4816aabd4.poster.avif?t=1794354750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/aca0758f781652c8315334e4816aabd4.webm?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/extras/aca0758f781652c8315334e4816aabd4.mp4?t=1794354750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relics, necromancers and bosses</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>50+ relics</strong> that change how your zombies work, fight and rise</li><li><strong>4 necromancers</strong>, each with their own starting relics</li><li><strong>4 shops</strong>: the Church sells parts, the Witch sells relics, the Blacksmith trades weapons and armor, and the Demonologist deals in demon parts</li><li><strong>3 bosses</strong> waiting at the end of each week</li><li><strong>Ritual levels</strong> that raise the stakes once you win, and an <strong>Endless Mode</strong> with ever harder waves and 50 events of its own</li></ul>", "short_description": "A roguelike auto-battler where you stitch zombies together from the body parts of the dead. Put your horde to work in the village by day, then send it against waves of demons by night. Over 50 relics, 4 necromancers, 3 bosses and an Endless Mode.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Czech, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, German, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459180/header.jpg?t=1794354750", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste